8	/**
9	 * Rejects a create-owner request whose city already contains {@value #CAPACITY} or more owners,
10	 * with a 409 Conflict. City is compared case-insensitively (matching the customer-code rule).
11	 * Runs after {@link BuildOwner} and before the owner is saved, so the count reflects only
12	 * pre-existing owners.
